// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
//
// Fused superkernel decode compile smoke test: builds the Peano decode kernels and
// the two ATTN_MAXL=2048 templates (decode_L2048 + decode_L2047 slope ref) through the
// AIR -> AIE -> aiecc -> Peano pipeline. Weights are runtime BOs, so this compile
// needs no weight data (like the prefill's run_npu2_compile.lit).
//
// The inline-attn merge requires a pre-change `llvm-link` (< LLVM 23) on PATH; the
// Makefile preflight aborts with a clear message otherwise (see README.md
// Reproducibility).
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano
//
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile clean
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile compile-decode PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: Decode build complete
